<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Astra says offers $100 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Astra says offers $100 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine oil firm Astra CAPSA said Friday that it and fellow Argentine firm YPF SA had offered about $100 million each to jointly raise their stake in Mexpetrol Argentina SA.</p>
<p>But Astra said the final price of the deal would not be known until negotiations to clinch the agreement conclude in about 30 days.</p>
</text>
